    https://github.com/russhughes/st7789_mpy

The prebuilt firmware images in that repository are the ones this project
expects to be running on; see docs/flashing.md.

---

src/vga1_8x8.py

The 8 x 8 VGA text font, carried unmodified from st7789_mpy's fonts/bitmap
directory so that the meter also runs on a firmware build that does not have
the font frozen in. The module is MIT licensed with the rest of st7789_mpy,
above. Its glyphs were converted from vga_8x8.bin in the romfont collection,
which gathers the text-mode fonts of old PC video ROMs; that collection notes
that the original copyright status of those ROM fonts is unclear, and they
have been reproduced in open-source projects for decades on that basis.

    https://github.com/russhughes/st7789_mpy/tree/master/fonts/bitmap
    https://github.com/spacerace/romfont

